From d45170da873bded983102a9a7e7bfa986c9c99fb Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sun, 22 Nov 2026 21:18:40 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 11/12] FP0801: report shell uses that no written type name
 covers

Static members of a forbidden type imported with using static are reported at
their name; instance members on a shell object whose type is written nowhere in
core (uncovered receiver) at the member name; a target-typed new of a forbidden
type for a parameter declared outside core at the new keyword.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
